From: Hari Naraayana Desikan Kannan <hnaraaya@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 06 May 2026 14:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] QSDK:PROTOCOL:sigma-dut: add OCE certification test case support

Add sigma-dut CAPI support for OCE AP certification test cases.

- Multi-radio interface: wlan{WLAN_TAG-1} for non-MLD (wlan0/1/2/3)
- BSSID always from wlan0; ath12k applies WLAN_TAG-1 offset to bytes 4+5
- MAX_WLAN_TAGS 3->4: WLAN_TAG=4 support for OCE guest BSS
- AssocReject/RSSIthreshold/RetryDelay (TC 4.3.x)
- ACS freqlist=2412 2437 2462 (TC 4.7.1)
- oce_rnr_scan_and_update(): STA VAP cross-band scan with two triggers:
  (1) background fork at ap_config_commit +90s (TC 4.5.x);
  (2) immediate when DownlinkAvailCap set via ap_set_rfeature (TC 4.8.x)
- IPSubnetIdentifier/ESSReport/TransmitPower (TC 4.11.1)
- DownlinkAvailCap/UplinkAvailCap dynamic update via hostapd SET +
  UPDATE_BEACON (TC 4.8.1/4.8.2)
- fils_realm/erp_domain/fils_cache_id/fils_hlp_wait_time (TC 4.9.x)
- OCE reset: ap_assoc_reject/rssi_threshold/retry_delay/pmf/oce_txpower/
  ip_subnet_id/ess_report initialized in ap_reset_default
- dl/ul_availcap reset to -1
- hapd_global_ctrl: add all confs for non-MLD multi-link
- Single-phy iface creation for non-MLD multi-link
- get_phy_from_iface: sysfs-based phy name resolution
- ieee80211w=1 for MBO+WPA2 PMF requirement
- rnr=1 for RNR IE in beacons

Patch-dependency: NA
Patch-work: NA

